<description>&lt;p&gt;Sudanese armed forces have continued drone strikes on markets in the disputed Abyei border region, killing dozens of civilians in each attack. Communal clashes persist between SSPDF and SPLA-IO forces in Kapoeta North, Eastern Equatoria, and in Wij-Panyikang, Upper Nile, while an ambush killed two people in Kajo-Keji County. Monitors warned of rising violence ahead of December elections and reported 40,000 people displaced by renewed Upper Nile fighting. The UCDP recorded two battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxNTkZja2JVNUJZenJ5Wlg3cEVkWVkzQkZvSmN5WmVoOXUwVG5kbW0zcExRdHIwYm5NWDJhNDlOcXpnWGpxZm5RbDJrU2hxTFVRVzJCZGVnYW1MVVFDU0tmZHB6S2tRWFNObWZSa0tQNnphSjJseWM4X3BrSDR0b0F6Vlp4OVU1aUJBNXVZaG1uZzZnWDY4d3VqNl9NbTUzeUxraUktMkNxbDVibTd0bTJ6cnVR?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivAFBVV95cUxQYkFPYTJiU2Z2YTd5Zl9Reko0ZHltQS1WR0xmUllkOTNrNWY5bVVEcFFZSXZVMkNlZ0RFWUJKaU96U0lIclNpQWplOHpPU0VNcUFidXJ3UWlzWXFlTXMtNFZHNG9BV0diSmVYNFVFR2NzOW45aEFzT1lOaHBEdFpuWG9zUV9IU3Z2YVNhY0wzRDNJVUFtZkQ0ZGcySWRNOTB3OWFFNjFDZzVVNWRXX1dIWEJDbThGX0l5Q1h3Wg?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinwFBVV95cUxQZHdPdHJvbUlsMVFnY29MWXpHZHZJQjN6dXRoVW5vVmp0Qng5ZjItd25wZ014Y29EMGFOWDY1b1JWdV9lRTcyS21leHVzNUQ3aTRDMU5wLTlqUXhoYXRuTkNjZUVVTjF1dFYyMzNLM0tieU9VNWhVUzJILTdWT3MzQ3VUc3Y5cGkxVjhpN3hXcGZielpTU0xITVo4eVpnRUU?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMifEFVX3lxTE5DYlFuZ2xsR2xmVFkxVHA3bzh2UWpaU0ZuTHpoQXRrVnc5a3ZqNlpQMy12cDJWX3FHUG1Kd0R1am1qaGR1S2hoTXRPdzhQRmR4X0xVVFNwbGFUR2k0dGsybGZKdWgzNEtZVTV3QXhyZHdsdWt0UTQ3OTIzX2Q?oc=5&quot;&g